{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1001_401pro", "source_sha256": "ac529a110002dd4fae92c1aefa3c8186e6b9e8a66ec21a939cf6254d3650c7c1", "ja": "（ここに朋花がいるって聞いたけど……\nおっ、あそこだ）", "zh": "（听说朋花在这里……哦，在那儿。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1003_401pro", "source_sha256": "92f6d474744b810b967a9efd1e9f150c2c7427ad54fe2d99eb1b1b0883c089b7", "ja": "（？　考え事かな……？）", "zh": "（？是在想什么吗……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "c6a75149a2e2b705882811ceda968ed112bab09f793093c6f308e136f3a02299", "ja": "プロデューサーさん？\n私に何か用事でも～？", "zh": "制作人？\n您找我有什么事吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1005_401pro", "source_sha256": "04e4a3dc93b4d6b9e30550fe948c65caaa1dff048628fa299cf6fdc45eaf9617", "ja": "あ、ごめん、邪魔しちゃったかな……あれ。\nいま、振り向く前から俺だって気づいて……？", "zh": "啊，抱歉，是不是打扰到你了……咦。\n你刚才在转过身之前，就已经注意到是我了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1006_401pro", "source_sha256": "3abb86d664049d203952c04f13c1af5cb4f58d6ce1efd7515450889b287e5abe", "ja": "ま、まぁ、いいか。\n朋花はここで何してたんだ？　考え事？", "zh": "那、那就算了。\n朋花刚才在这里做什么？在思考事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "35db14aeea966231c3bc7954e48ce8db7b35c027a97f9470acc17e3f0c9003c7", "ja": "……。そうですね～。", "zh": "……。是呀～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "9696da8d316de27625352faed948449e9686f235bd7709b6d8e5c31fd7230be6", "ja": "アイドルになってから、考えることが増えたような\n……そんなことを考えていました。", "zh": "成为偶像之后，好像要思考的事情变多了……\n我刚才一直在想这些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "f279216b58a4101f9d30f97c83379ca78b357969be669efbca7949ecbaddff02", "ja": "ひとつひとつのお仕事もそうですし、\n劇場公演のことも……それから、未来のことも。", "zh": "每一份工作都是如此，剧场公演也是……还有，关于未来的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "75275154660d126af5998369375289e3479e87de2d30ce8db090716fe0f69e61", "ja": "珍しくて驚くこともありますが、それらすべてで、\n聖母の輝きは増していくのでしょうね。", "zh": "其中也会有些罕见得令人惊讶的事，不过，圣母的光辉也会在这一切之中不断增强吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "2841368955d0838d5f257a98897a0dbb4c4aaad43c6181f9f0a2272ee71cbfc2", "ja": "うん。朋花のファン……じゃなくて、子豚ちゃんが\n増えているのも、そんな朋花の努力の成果だよ。", "zh": "嗯。朋花的粉丝……不对，是小猪仔越来越多，也是朋花努力的成果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "d9e90bd0f05d93baaf36b5def3e48f16ce2db17162ff0cac2ac7c9889a849435", "ja": "努力……。必要な準備をするのは当然のことですから。\nしないなら、最初からやる気がないということです～。", "zh": "努力……做好必要的准备是理所当然的。要是不做，那从一开始就没有干劲啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1013_401pro", "source_sha256": "4ea28bd071d04d9c7d0a3f6fd44bfbb25d43b158aee7e698c8043e99e7081d87", "ja": "はは、朋花は手厳しいな。その通りとは思うけど、\nあまり自分に向けるんじゃないぞ？　そういう……", "zh": "哈哈，朋花还真是严格啊。虽然我也觉得你说得没错，但别总是对自己这么苛刻，好吗？那种……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "22eba54b8bf00f0c29c38295fcd9c0af590f4f232914c46429fb6b64648db42b", "ja": "そんなことより。私に用事があったのでは～？", "zh": "比起那个。你找我是有事要说的吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "3bfe91b4ae78e347b72d9b5d07c7410c6a763f15f79b224d37fb899e5d3201c8", "ja": "あ！　そうなんだ、レッスンルームの予約のことで。\n今日の午後は朋花が部屋を押さえてるよな？", "zh": "啊！对了，是关于预约练习室的事。\n今天下午是朋花预约了房间吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1016_401pro", "source_sha256": "b121b5ff4019898617e61fe7ad3e5c8d1bdb1d8a9ef2919d67f00012cab7e6ae", "ja": "たしか個人練習って言ってたけど、\nその……合同で使いたいって希望者が現れて。", "zh": "我记得好像说是要进行个人练习，不过……有人希望一起使用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "a7eccc987fda7f188b3c1c85e568b6b307890eb8aa54cfcbc6cfb222b140558a", "ja": "そうですか。レッスンルームは広いですから、\n私は構いませんよ～。ちなみに、どなたが？", "zh": "这样啊。练习室很宽敞，我没关系哦～顺便问一下，是谁呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "e9ff32b74a0156f280ab739dcda5dc4624c50e8e3a6dd4e0ca9816d5a986f3df", "ja": "……まつりが。", "zh": "……茉莉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "703e5df9da770d05fc6c9ffaedb09276b1613c8db48208ac481336322cc27ff3", "ja": "まつりさんが。そうですか～。", "zh": "是祭莉小姐啊。这样啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "47c6a7c1a37645eb17a12104b64ec0322dbb2b6b7a00dc8eb7ed6b8ffdd387e0", "ja": "なんか間があったよね！？　やっぱり二人は、その、\nこう……ケンカしてたりするのかな？？", "zh": "刚才是不是有点停顿！？难道那两个人，那个……该不会是在吵架吧？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1022_031tom", "source_sha256": "968992ee284728ff32c0e6611d4a60f8ec94f0f84908f1d101671b9be2447486", "ja": "何を言ってるんですか～？\nおかしなプロデューサーさんですね～？", "zh": "你在说什么呀～？\n真是位奇怪的制作人呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "d37f17c60a85020008f00f59aad25a5c72065eff0020102c905cbb54fc94baa9", "ja": "まつりさんとは、とっても仲良くお付き合いさせて\nいただいていますよ～？　それはもう、とっても♪", "zh": "我和茉莉相处得非常非常要好哦～？\n可以说是非常要好呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1024_401pro", "source_sha256": "ecc6fe07af3b0a07d1d181e7ca4e85f239e634d1b288f8908f9da91cf513f620", "ja": "そ、そう？　ならいいんだけど……。\nいまいち、そうは聞こえなかったけど……。", "zh": "这、这样吗？那就好……  \n不过，听起来好像不太像那么回事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1025_031tom", "source_sha256": "e60edf9f6407d11aecb4ff353f1509cfb0bc4d79d3e208c983b1cb09e5172360", "ja": "では、私は用事を思い出したのでこれで。\nお先に……失礼しますね～？？？", "zh": "那么，我想起还有点事，就先告辞了。\n我先走一步……失陪啦～？？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0663_1027_401pro", "source_sha256": "b8d6d2ad88443296260718243e4fc8afc3cbedb2f89bf728e8a440e741ee44a1", "ja": "って、寒っ！？\nなんで空気が冷えてるんだ……？", "zh": "等等，好冷！？  \n为什么空气变冷了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
